caption: Metamorphic — Partitioned Anatomy
tradition-component: metamorphic-partitioned-anatomy

A Metamorphic Spawn may purchase multiple Alternate Forms normally. Spawn does not provide a special discount on Alternate Form, and each form must have a complete legal construction.

Metamorphic also permits the character to apply Only While in [Specific Alternate Form] to any Super or Psi ability, regardless of which Domain or Tradition granted that ability, provided the ability's expression is compatible with that form. The ability is purchased separately from the Alternate Form unless its own construction says otherwise. Use ordinary limitation pricing appropriate to the actual availability of the specified form.

Different powers may be assigned to different forms. A character can therefore develop distinct hunting, aquatic, void, war, or other bodies whose supernatural faculties are partitioned among them. An ability limited to one form is completely unavailable outside that form.
